4:["$","p","Thorneberry brings those conversations together. We help importers, distributors, hospitals, clinics and institutional procurement teams structure a requirement and coordinate the next steps with relevant Pakistan-based supply channels.",{"children":"Thorneberry brings those conversations together. We help importers, distributors, hospitals, clinics and institutional procurement teams structure a requirement and coordinate the next steps with relevant Pakistan-based supply channels."}]
5:["$","p","Thorneberry is presented as a sourcing and export-coordination partner. Product availability, supplier attribution, documentation and lead time are reviewed per inquiry rather than promised universally.",{"children":"Thorneberry is presented as a sourcing and export-coordination partner. Product availability, supplier attribution, documentation and lead time are reviewed per inquiry rather than promised universally."}]
